  "Ranking Insights — Articles (Priority Keywords)": "Article-level priority keywords only began being tracked from mid-January, so trend reads are shorter, but the trajectory is positive: Page-1 totals have grown from 46 to 57–58 keywords and AI Overview presence has more than doubled, from 7 to 12–13 keywords. This is a smaller keyword set than Cyberglossary, but it's moving in the right direction on both classic rankings and AI visibility simultaneously.",
